      "amount": "0.5 g"
    },
    {
      "name": "toasted sesame seeds",
      "amount": "1 g"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat 800 ml water with dashi powder, kelp, garlic, ginger, salt, and pepper until it comes to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat and simmer for 10 minutes to develop the broth.",
    "Add the sliced shiitake mushrooms and scallions, cooking for an additional 3 minutes.",
    "Gently fold in the foie gras pieces and simmer for 5 minutes until the foie gras is heated through.",
    "Remove the pot from heat, stir in sesame oil, and sprinkle toasted sesame seeds over the surface.",
    "Serve the soup hot, garnished with an extra pinch of pepper if desired."
